      "target": "## 要解决的问题\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0008",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "3576703759a62f8b3057518475b450ce5ba995a79fb5ecf76f96d7b55a8a2b3e",
      "target": "你有一段 5 秒的音频：狗叫声、有人大喊“停！”，随后一片安静。值得回答的问题涉及多个维度：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0010",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0011",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "fc9f015807b842a625d6b2d7be01a9c5d546e338e19c198300ac8ae24c1c7e46",
      "target": "- **转写。** “说了什么？”这是自动语音识别（ASR）的范畴。\n- **语义推理。** “这个人是否处于危险之中？”这需要联合理解狗叫声 + 喊声 + 随后的安静。\n- **音乐推理。** “哪些乐器在演奏旋律？”\n- **长音频检索。** “在这段 90 分钟的讲座中，讲师在哪里讲解了梯度下降？”\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0012",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "068464b8040cd2c5c12250de6cd2d2562a0863d5819ca9621ebbe136b20368d2",
      "target": "只用一个提示词（prompt）就能回答上述所有问题的单一模型，就是 **音频语言模型（audio-language model）** (LALM / ALM)。它与纯 ASR 不同：LALM 会生成自由形式的自然语言回答，而不只是转写文本。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0014",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
