    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0020",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The three-component template"
