      "ordinal": 10,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The three-component template"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "c86b21edb57e8d9d7873345980957e948b88cd88eec1ddc1c9541a46d45e6f11",
      "target": "2026 年的每一种 LALM 都有相同的基本结构：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0022",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The three-component template"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0023",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The three-component template"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "5271e67b69e371a812da634e65257726f26f232e2a91eeb92f948e90f603cbfb",
      "target": "1. **音频编码器（audio encoder）。** Whisper 编码器 · BEATs · CLAP · WavLM · 或各模型自行定制的编码器。\n2. **投影器（projector）。** 通过线性层或多层感知机（MLP），把音频编码器的特征映射到大语言模型（LLM）的 token 嵌入空间（embedding space）。token 是模型处理的序列单位，文本语境中称为词元。\n3. **LLM。** 基于 Llama / Qwen / Gemma 的解码器。接收交错排列的文本 + 音频 token，生成文本。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0024",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The three-component template"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The three-component template"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "9aa2dab970b4babb5cae8f8493a7d88792060fc8120426fcaf9cec534f69dc3f",
      "target": "训练过程：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0026",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The three-component template"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0027",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The three-component template"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "9776ad8e22c54cda473e5d6ac983601d7a97443986ae4e0bb81521b077146890",
      "target": "- **阶段 1。** 冻结编码器 + LLM；在 ASR / 描述生成数据上仅训练投影器。\n- **阶段 2。** 在遵循指令的音频任务（QA 问答、推理、音乐理解）上进行全量微调（fine-tuning）或 LoRA（低秩适配）微调。\n- **阶段 3（可选）。** 为语音输入 / 语音输出增加语音解码器。Qwen2.5-Omni 和 AF3-Chat 采用了这种方式。\n"
    },
    {
