      "source_sha256": "9ebb92bb9e4d3cba02535f1e096b88841d1a54fa6a1856f400464818b715b668",
      "target": "### 步骤 1：向 Qwen2.5-Omni 提问\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0054",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
