        "### Step 1: query Qwen2.5-Omni"
      ],
      "ordinal": 27,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0055",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 1: query Qwen2.5-Omni"
      ],
      "ordinal": 28,
      "source_sha256": "e394fdbce6085c60bd37fae8bc90523d9604a7fdc2ff93d75daecd70525a0ad1",
      "target": "```python\nfrom transformers import AutoModelForCausalLM, AutoProcessor\n\nprocessor = AutoProcessor.from_pretrained(\"Qwen/Qwen2.5-Omni-7B\")\nmodel = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(\"Qwen/Qwen2.5-Omni-7B\", torch_dtype=\"auto\")\n\naudio, sr = load_wav(\"clip.wav\", sr=16000)\nmessages = [{\n    \"role\": \"user\",\n    \"content\": [\n        {\"type\": \"audio\", \"audio\": audio},\n        {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"What sounds do you hear, and what's happening?\"},\n    ],\n}]\ninputs = processor.apply_chat_template(messages, tokenize=True, return_tensors=\"pt\")\noutput = model.generate(**inputs, max_new_tokens=200)\nprint(processor.decode(output[0], skip_special_tokens=True))\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0056",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 1: query Qwen2.5-Omni"
      ],
      "ordinal": 28,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0057",
