        "### Step 2: the projector pattern"
      ],
      "ordinal": 29,
      "source_sha256": "b02bbbf0c69e45cbc87cf8d82112540e2b49c81ab1c61e9fc85fd3e0a91c1bd9",
      "target": "### 步骤 2：投影器模式\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0058",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: the projector pattern"
      ],
      "ordinal": 29,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0059",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: the projector pattern"
      ],
      "ordinal": 30,
      "source_sha256": "05572f4419b27a714ac8df8ee9708f8c228bd565f0a4262f92cc180d656ef5fd",
      "target": "```python\nimport torch.nn as nn\n\nclass AudioProjector(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, audio_dim=1280, llm_dim=4096):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.down = nn.Linear(audio_dim, llm_dim)\n        self.act = nn.GELU()\n        self.up = nn.Linear(llm_dim, llm_dim)\n\n    def forward(self, audio_features):\n        return self.up(self.act(self.down(audio_features)))\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0060",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: the projector pattern"
      ],
      "ordinal": 30,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Audio-Language Models — Qwen2.5-Omni, Audio Flamingo, GPT-4o Audio",
        "## Build It",
        "### Step 2: the projector pattern"
      ],
      "ordinal": 31,
      "source_sha256": "e0c4e0791ba9b8b37c999dd103edab2b6095558789305fdd5fe00d04b15b2d00",
      "target": "就这么简单。投影器通常由 1-3 个线性层组成。用 ASR 数据对（音频 → 转写文本）训练它，就是阶段 1 的前置任务（pretext task）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "06-10:b0062",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
